  "summary": "The manager narrows it down to one person, staring across the desk; she denies it flatly and without heat.",
  "shots": "Entry state, re-anchored to the reference image: 钱经理 (S3) is leaning on the far side of the desk with one palm flat on it, back to the window; 苏小满 (S1) stands on the NEAR side of the desk with her back to the door, facing him; 小唐 (S4) is against the wall just inside the LEFT door.\n[Shot 1] Medium over the desk: 钱经理 (S3) straightens up slowly, tucks both hands behind his back and tips his head to one side, fixing her with the look of a man who has already decided, and speaks in a flat accusing Mandarin, one phrase at a time: [Chinese] 收台的时候，就你一个人在。\n[Shot 2] At 00:05.600, reverse single on 苏小满 (S1) on the near side of the desk, the blind-light barring the wall behind her; she does not move her feet and does not look away, and answers at once in a low steady Mandarin: [Chinese] 不是我。\n[Shot 3] At 00:07.800, wide two-shot across the desk, both of them motionless at either side of it, the room very still, 小唐 (S4) a small pale shape at the edge of frame with her mouth shut.\n[Shot 4] At 00:09.200, the camera creeps a few centimetres closer on the desk surface between them. Neither of them speaks.",
  "soundscape": "A clock ticking on the wall, the low hum of the ceiling lights, one nervous swallow, faint corridor noise beyond the door.",
  "music": "N/A",
  "crowd": false,
  "style_pack": "lean",
  "_lean_shots": "[Shot 1] Medium over the desk: 钱经理 (S3) straightens up slowly, tucks both hands behind his back and tips his head to one side, fixing her with the look of a man who has already decided, and speaks in a flat accusing Mandarin, one phrase at a time: [Chinese] 收台的时候，就你一个人在。\n[Shot 2] At 00:05.600, reverse single on 苏小满 (S1) on the near side of the desk, the blind-light barring the wall behind her; she does not move her feet and does not look away, and answers at once in a low steady Mandarin: [Chinese] 不是我。\n[Shot 3] At 00:07.800, wide two-shot across the desk, both of them motionless at either side of it, the room very still, 小唐 (S4) a small pale shape at the edge of frame with her mouth shut.\n[Shot 4] At 00:09.200, the camera creeps a few centimetres closer on the desk surface between them. Neither of them speaks."
