  "summary": "The cleaner turns the accusation back on the witness; the girl retreats into her own certainty.",
  "shots": "Entry state, re-anchored to the reference image: 苏小满 (S1) on the near side of the desk with her back to the door; 小唐 (S4) has taken one step in from the wall, lower-left of frame; 钱经理 (S3) on the far side of the desk.\n[Shot 1] Medium: 苏小满 (S1) turns her head and shoulders toward the door, fixing 小唐 (S4) with an even, unhurried look, and says it quietly in low steady Mandarin, without raising her voice at all: [Chinese] 小唐。看清楚了，再说。\n[Shot 2] At 00:05.600, close on 小唐 (S4): she shrinks her neck down into her collar, plants one hand on the doorframe behind her, looks anywhere but at the cleaner, and answers in a thin defensive Mandarin: [Chinese] 反正，我看见了。\n[Shot 3] At 00:08.600, wide: the two women staged one behind the other along the room's depth axis — 小唐 (S4) nearer the door, 苏小满 (S1) nearer the desk — with 钱经理 (S3) motionless behind the desk, back to the window, watching them like a spectator, arms folded.\n[Shot 4] At 00:09.600, hold. Nobody moves and nobody speaks.",
  "soundscape": "Two quiet voices in a hard-surfaced room, a chair leg scraping, the wall clock ticking, muffled office noise from the corridor.",
  "music": "N/A",
  "crowd": false,
  "style_pack": "lean",
  "_lean_shots": "[Shot 1] Medium: 苏小满 (S1) turns her head and shoulders toward the door, fixing 小唐 (S4) with an even, unhurried look, and says it quietly in low steady Mandarin, without raising her voice at all: [Chinese] 小唐。看清楚了，再说。\n[Shot 2] At 00:05.600, close on 小唐 (S4): she shrinks her neck down into her collar, plants one hand on the doorframe behind her, looks anywhere but at the cleaner, and answers in a thin defensive Mandarin: [Chinese] 反正，我看见了。\n[Shot 3] At 00:08.600, wide: the two women staged one behind the other along the room's depth axis — 小唐 (S4) nearer the door, 苏小满 (S1) nearer the desk — with 钱经理 (S3) motionless behind the desk, back to the window, watching them like a spectator, arms folded.\n[Shot 4] At 00:09.600, hold. Nobody moves and nobody speaks."
 },
