  "summary": "He orders her to empty her pockets, offering the alternative of security; she holds her ground and refuses to be searched.",
  "shots": "Entry state, re-anchored to the reference image: 钱经理 (S3) is stepping round the end of the desk onto the NEAR side and closing to one pace in front of 苏小满 (S1); 苏小满 (S1) is on the near side of the desk with her back to the door; 小唐 (S4) is by the door at the lower-left.\n[Shot 1] Medium: 钱经理 (S3) walks two paces around the corner of the desk toward her, stops at the distance of an outstretched arm, taps his own hip pocket twice with two fingers and speaks in a hard flat Mandarin, not loud, not shouting: [Chinese] 掏兜。自己掏，还是我喊保安。\n[Shot 2] At 00:07.200, reverse single on 苏小满 (S1): she takes one small half-step back, and her right hand closes slowly over the fabric of her own trouser pocket; she speaks quietly and clearly in low steady Mandarin: [Chinese] 你们不能搜我。\n[Shot 3] At 00:09.400, close on the pocket under her fingers, the fabric pulled slightly taut. She is silent after that.",
  "soundscape": "Tense quiet, his knuckles tapping cloth, a shoe shifting on tile, the fluorescent hum, distant corridor chatter.",
  "music": "A low sustained synth note, tight and uneasy.",
  "crowd": false,
  "style_pack": "lean",
  "_lean_shots": "[Shot 1] Medium: 钱经理 (S3) walks two paces around the corner of the desk toward her, stops at the distance of an outstretched arm, taps his own hip pocket twice with two fingers and speaks in a hard flat Mandarin, not loud, not shouting: [Chinese] 掏兜。自己掏，还是我喊保安。\n[Shot 2] At 00:07.200, reverse single on 苏小满 (S1): she takes one small half-step back, and her right hand closes slowly over the fabric of her own trouser pocket; she speaks quietly and clearly in low steady Mandarin: [Chinese] 你们不能搜我。\n[Shot 3] At 00:09.400, close on the pocket under her fingers, the fabric pulled slightly taut. She is silent after that."
